+\section{Data Processing and Evidence Flow}
+\label{sec:processingflow}
+EchoForge should be read as a pipeline, not as a collection of disconnected diagnostics. It first samples scenario groups from public-proxy strata, expands each group into three phase records, generates synthetic radar/IQ and cue products, materializes model-facing detector views through a denylisted schema, searches/calibrates only on train/CV rows, writes a selection lock, and scores the blind holdout once. Figure~\ref{fig:processingflow} is the reviewer-facing trace.
