+  \label{fig:eiprogress}
+\end{figure*}
+The EI source appendix marks baseline comparator code and EI code with different backgrounds. This is not a black-box claim: the code is available, the selection lock is available, and the paper records which rows are human-designed comparator logic versus EI/generative-origin tagged logic. The optional encrypted IP excerpt is an escrow-style duplicate of the most novel EI lines; it is not required to reproduce the reported metrics.
+
+\subsection{Alternative Objectives}
+Future EI objectives include minimizing false alarms per 1000 negatives at a minimum recall constraint, maximizing group-level recall, optimizing take-up recall separately from cruise recall, penalizing single-family false-alarm concentration, and combining calibration quality, F1, and low-FPR recall into a Pareto frontier.
